 "rules": [
  {
   "name": "classify_kind_family",
   "comment": "effect_family = family of the most-specific signal-word found in the kind's NAME (Argmax by spec). Name-matched so generic words in definitions don't pollute; specificity breaks multi-word ties (rotary switch -> discrete_select). Single-fire per kind. OPEN: more signals/kinds extend it, no code.",
